    {
      "id": "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0035",
      "paragraphId": "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:p0035",
      "tag": "p",
      "domPath": "main/p[39]",
      "tableContext": null,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "AL自己2位，差一手就能够三色听牌。",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "AL自己2位，差一手就能够三色听牌。",
          "marks": [],
          "href": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0036",
      "paragraphId": "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:p0036",
      "tag": "p",
      "domPath": "main/p[40]",
      "tableContext": null,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "一发中里宝或者自摸中1里宝就能够逆转的状况的话，即立是正确的。",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "一发中里宝或者自摸中1里宝就能够逆转的状况的话，即立是正确的。",
          "marks": [],
          "href": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0037",
      "paragraphId": "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:p0037",
      "tag": "p",
      "domPath": "main/p[41]",
      "tableContext": null,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "特别是3900点以内的点差，默听是损失非常大的打法。",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "特别是3900点以内的点差，默听是损失非常大的打法。",
          "marks": [],
          "href": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0038",
      "paragraphId": "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:p0038",
      "tag": "p",
      "domPath": "main/p[42]",
      "tableContext": null,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "和摸6万的概率相比，一发或者中里宝的概率要更大，这个大家用常识就可以知道的。",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "和摸6万的概率相比，一发或者中里宝的概率要更大，这个大家用常识就可以知道的。",
          "marks": [],
          "href": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0039",
      "paragraphId": "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:p0039",
      "tag": "p",
      "domPath": "main/p[43]",
      "tableContext": null,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "如果必须要自摸满贯的话，可以默听等摸6万改良。",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "如果必须要自摸满贯的话，可以默听等摸6万改良。",
          "marks": [],
          "href": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0040",
      "paragraphId": "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:p0040",
      "tag": "p",
      "domPath": "main/p[44]",
      "tableContext": null,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "但是，在三色做成之前荣牌打出来当然是要和的。能够改良的牌只有一种，而且就算改良了也要和出高目。",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "但是，在三色做成之前荣牌打出来当然是要和的。能够改良的牌只有一种，而且就算改良了也要和出高目。",
          "marks": [],
          "href": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0041",
      "paragraphId": "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:p0041",
      "tag": "p",
      "domPath": "main/p[45]",
      "tableContext": null,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "太过于期待这种苛刻的条件也是需要禁止的。",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "太过于期待这种苛刻的条件也是需要禁止的。",
          "marks": [],
          "href": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0042",
      "paragraphId": "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:p0042",
      "tag": "p",
      "domPath": "main/p[46]",
      "tableContext": null,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "（待续）",
      "segments": [
        {
